更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS"],"特殊餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiz5K-Mu9KWAxU1bvUHHY9nEmYQ3YcHCG4oAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiz5K-Mu9KWAxU1bvUHHY9nEmYQ3IcHCG0oDg",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["20260509[首刷]\n本次評價『很好吃』👍👍👍\n\n[牛人-中等 二郎系拉麵] 400\n這款主打濃厚牛脂的二郎拉麵真不錯，上面有淋上油膩的牛脂，湯頭也有油脂和了蒜泥提升刺激度，整體味道非常濃厚有勁。\n拉麵上面鋪上兩片軟嫩好吃的牛肉片，還有糖心蛋、筍乾、野菜、豆芽菜鋪好撲滿，挖了老半天才挖出底下的中卷麵。\n\n[泡菜、高麗菜]\n店家有提供一些泡菜和豆芽菜的小菜和佐料，可以自己拿，也不會辣歐。\n\n_____________心得文______________\n網路上看到這碗拉麵，心瞬間被吸走了，安排了週末中午來嘗鮮。\n店面較小，但是店裡竟然有養貓！？還讓他到處跑跑跳跳，蠻可愛的😮\n這碗拉麵中等分量真的很多，油脂也非常濃郁，還好沒有點大碗，不然我的肚子一定撐爆。",null,[0,25]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6946724822011807759/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEwU2xWWVpGSmxhMVpoWlVVeFFtTlZhRU5YUmxJd1ZtcE5kMlZJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6946724822011807759/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEwU2xWWVpGSmxhMVpoWlVVeFFtTlZhRU5YUmxJd1ZtcE5kMlZJWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6946724822011807759/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEwU2xWWVpGSmxhMVpoWlVVeFFtTlZhRU5YUmxJd1ZtcE5kMlZJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6946724822011807759/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEwU2xWWVpGSmxhMVpoWlVVeFFtTlZhRU5YUmxJd1ZtcE5kMlZJWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6946724822011807759/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEwU2xWWVpGSmxhMVpoWlVVeFFtTlZhRU5YUmxJd1ZtcE5kMlZJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6946724822011807759/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjEwU2xWWVpGSmxhMVpoWlVVeFFtTlZhRU5YUmxJd1ZtcE5kMlZJWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,6005,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210SlVYZFJla1ZhZUUxQmNVaENXRlIwVmpNd2VIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xc9a138113331d819!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodCh